Generative AI Models and Limitations

The Service incorporates generative AI models provided by third-party AI model
providers, including but not limited to Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, and other
model providers. When you use the Service, your prompts, attached content, and
other inputs may be transmitted to these third-party providers for processing,
and your use of the Service is also subject to those providers' applicable
terms and policies.

Generative AI models, like the ones you are interacting with, strive to be
helpful and informative. However, they can occasionally produce responses that
are incorrect, misleading, or not grounded in fact. This phenomenon is often
referred to as "hallucinating" information. It is a known limitation of current
AI technology.

Users should exercise caution and not rely solely on AI-generated content for
high-stakes decisions or critical advice. It is always advisable to verify
information through additional reliable sources.

If you encounter a response that you believe is incorrect or unhelpful, please
let us know. You can provide feedback using the designated tools or contact us
directly at support@commandcode.ai.

